<ul>
<li>Riskified reported Q2 2026 revenue of $98.7 million, up 22% year
over year and its strongest revenue growth in more than four years.</li>
<li>Non-GAAP gross profit increased 13% to $45.4 million, while adjusted
EBITDA rose 84% to $3.9 million. Gross margin was 46%, reflecting a
higher mix of new merchants and ticketing activity.</li>
<li>Digital finance revenue grew approximately 180% year over year,
driven by new merchants in event contracts and gaming. Tickets and
travel grew approximately 23%.</li>
<li>The multiproduct merchant base expanded approximately 50% year over
year, while competitive win rates remained above 75%. The value of ACH
transactions processed was approximately 19 times the prior-year
level.</li>
<li>Management raised full-year revenue guidance to $400 million–$410
million and adjusted EBITDA guidance to $33 million–$39 million.</li>
<li>Riskified ended the quarter with $223.6 million in cash, deposits
and investments, no debt, and generated $12.9 million of free cash
flow.</li>
</ul>
