uidance to $400 million–$410\nmillion and adjusted EBITDA guidance to $33 million–$39 million.\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003ERiskified ended the quarter with $223.6 million in cash, deposits\nand investments, no debt, and generated $12.9 million of free cash\nflow.\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\n\u003C\u002Ful\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"key-financial-data\"\u003EKey Financial Data\u003C\u002Fh2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv style=\"max-width: 100%; overflow-x: auto;\"\u003E\u003Ctable style=\"width:100%; border-collapse: collapse;\" border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"5\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth style=\"width:150px;\"\u003EMetric\u003C\u002Fth\u003E\u003Cth style=\"width:120px;\"\u003EQ2 2026\u003C\u002Fth\u003E\u003Cth style=\"width:120px;\"\u003EYear-over-year change \u002F context\u003C\u002Fth\u003E\u003C\u002Ftr\u003E\u003C\u002Fthead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd style=\"width:150px;\"\u003EGMV\u003C\u002Ftd\u003E\u003Ctd style=\"width:120px;\"\u003E$41.3 million\u003C\u002Ftd\u003E\u003Ctd style=\"width:120px;\"\u003EUp 13%\u003C\u002Ftd\u003E\u003C\u002Ftr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd style=\"width:150px;\"\u003ERevenue\u003C\u002Ftd\u003E\u003Ctd style=\"width:120px;\"\u003E$98.7 million\u003C\u002Ftd\u003E\u003Ctd style=\"width:120px;\"\u003EUp 22%\u003C\u002Ftd\u003E\u003C\u002Ftr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd style=\"width:150px;\"\u003ENon-GAAP gross profit\u003C\u002Ftd\u003E\u003Ctd style=\"width:120px;\"\u003E$45.4 million\u003C\u002Ftd\u003E\u003Ctd style=\"width:120px;\"\u003EUp 13%\u003C\u002Ftd\u003E\u003C\u002Ftr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd style=\"width:150px;\"\u003EGross margin\u003C\u002Ftd\u003E\u003Ctd style=\"width:120px;\"\u003E46%\u003C\u002Ftd\u003E\u003Ctd style=\"width:120px;\"\u003EAffected by new merchant ramps and business mix\u003C\u002Ftd\u003E\u003C\u002Ftr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd style=\"width:150px;\"\u003ENon-GAAP operating expenses\u003C\u002Ftd\u003E\u003Ctd style=\"width:120px;\"\u003E$41.5 million\u003C\u002Ftd\u003E\u003Ctd style=\"width:120px;\"\u003E42% of revenue versus 47% in Q2 2025\u003C\u002Ftd\u003E\u003C\u002Ftr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd style=\"width:150px;\"\u003EAdjusted EBITDA\u003C\u002Ftd\u003E\u003Ctd style=\"width:120px;\"\u003E$3.9 million\u003C\u002Ftd\u003E\u003Ctd style=\"width:120px;\"\u003EUp 84% from $2.1 million\u003C\u002Ftd\u003E\u003C\u002Ftr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd style=\"width:150px;\"\u003EGAAP net loss\u003C\u002Ftd\u003E\u003Ctd style=\"width:120px;\"\u003E$9.1 million\u003C\u002Ftd\u003E\u003Ctd style=\"width:120px;\"\u003EImproved 22% from a $11.6 million loss\u003C\u002Ftd\u003E\u003C\u002Ftr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd style=\"width:150px;\"\u003EFree cash flow\u003C\u002Ftd\u003E\u003Ctd style=\"width:120px;\"\u003E$12.9 million\u003C\u002Ftd\u003E\u003Ctd style=\"width:120px;\"\u003EPositive during the quarter\u003C\u002Ftd\u003E\u003C\u002Ftr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd style=\"width:150px;\"\u003ECash, deposits and investments\u003C\u002Ftd\u003E\u003Ctd style=\"width:120px;\"\u003E$223.6 million\u003C\u002Ftd\u003E\u003Ctd style=\"width:120px;\"\u003EZero debt\u003C\u002Ftd\u003E\u003C\u002Ftr\u003E\u003C\u002Ftbody\u003E\u003C\u002Ftable\u003E\u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E\n","language":"en","sourceLink":"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.tradingkey.com\u002Fnews\u002Ftranscripts\u002F262107619-tradingkey","instruments":[]},"analysisRecommendArticle":[{"title":"Gold Price Forecast: US Inflation Expected to Slow, October CPI May Support Gold Breaking Above $4,200","publish_time":1794301779,"update_time":1794301779,"image":"https:\u002F\u002Fresource.mistorebox.com\u002Finsights\u002Fcms_uploads\u002Fimg\u002Fdownload\u002Fxauusd-3e2f13d635024bc5b2aca4e79291c236.jpg","route":"tradingkey-XAUUSDXAGUSDUSDOLLARF-202611101709","views":726,"abstract":"As of Tuesday's Asian session (November 10), gold prices (XAUUSD) pulled back slightly today after surging on Monday, falling about 0.56% intraday to trade near $4,120. Earlier, gold rose","type_id":1038,"typ